1	line	Ulizius	Absolutely not! I've been given strict instructions not to let anyone through. It's just too dangerous. No one gets in without Drezels say so!
1	line	Player	But I'm doing a quest for Drezel!
1	line	Ulizius	Ok, on your way then!
1	action	end
