0	section	Talking to Drezel
1	line	Player	Hello again! I'm helping Filliman, he plans to become a nature spirit. I have a spell to cast but first I need to be blessed. Can you bless me?
1	line	Drezel	But you haven't sneezed!
1	line	Player	You're so funny!
1	line	Player	But can you bless me?
1	line	Drezel	Very well my friend, prepare yourself for the blessings of Saradomin. Here we go!
1	line	Drezel	Ashustru, blessidium, adverturasi, fidum!
1	line	Drezel	There you go my friend, you're now blessed. It's funny, now I look at you, there seems to be something of the faith about you. Anyway, good luck with your quest!
1	line	Player	Many thanks!
1	action	end
0	section	Subsequent dialogue with Drezel
1	line	Drezel	How's life been treating you since you got blessed?
1	line	Player	Not so bad!
1	line	Drezel	It's funny, because when I look at you, there does seem to be something of the faith about you. Have you considered a life of service to Saradomin?
1	line	Player	I serve Saradomin in other ways.
1	line	Drezel	Fair enough!
1	action	end
