2	box	You show the fungus to Filliman.
2	line	Filliman Tarlock	Wonderful, the mushroom represents 'something from nature'. Now we need to work out what the other components of the spell are!
2	select	Select an option
2	option	What are the things that are needed?
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	The three things are: 'Something with faith', 'something from nature' and 'something of the spirit-to-become freely given'.
3	line	Player	Ok, and 'something from nature' is the mushroom from the bloom spell you gave me?
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	Yes, that's correct, that seems right to me. The other things we need are 'something with faith' and 'something of the spirit-to-become freely given.
3	line	Player	Do you have any ideas what those things are?
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	I'm sorry my friend, but I do not.
