2	option	What should I do when I have those things?
3	line	Player	What should we do when we have those things?
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	Ah yes, I looked this up. It says,.. 'to arrange upon three rocks around the spirit-to-become...'. Then I must cast a spell. As you can see, I've already placed the rocks. I must have planned to do this before I died!
3	line	Player	Can we just place the components on any rock?
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	Well, the only thing the journal says is that 'something with faith stands south of the spirit-to-become', but I'm so confused now I don't really know what that means. Oh, if only I had all my faculties!
3	action	initial
