0	section	Talking to Filliman inside his grove
1	cond	If the player searches the grotto:
2	line	Filliman Tarlock	Well, hello there again, I was just enjoying the grotto. Many thanks for your help, I couldn't have become a Spirit of nature without you.
2	line	Filliman Tarlock	I must complete the transformation now. Just stand there and watch the show, apparently it's quite good!
2	line	Nature Spirit	Hmmm, good, the transformation is complete. Now, my friend, in return for your assistance, I will help you to kill the Ghasts. First bring to me a silver sickle so that I can bless it for you.
2	line	Player	A silver sickle? What's that?
2	line	Nature Spirit	The sickle is the symbol and weapon of the Druid, you need to construct one of silver so that I can bless it, with its powers you will be able to defeat the Ghasts of Mort Myre.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Where would I get a silver sickle?
3	line	Player	Where would I get a silver sickle?
3	line	Nature Spirit	You could make one yourself if you're artisan enough. I've heard of a distant sandy place where you can buy the mould that you require, it's similar in many respects to the creating of a holy symbol.
3	action	initial
2	option	What will you do to the silver sickle?
3	line	Player	What will you do to the silver sickle?
3	line	Nature Spirit	Why, I will give it my blessings so that the very swamp in which you stand will blossom and bloom!
3	action	initial
2	option	How can a blessed sickle help me to defeat the Ghasts?
3	line	Player	How can a blessed sickle help me to defeat the Ghasts?
3	line	Nature Spirit	My blessings will entice nature to bloom in Mort Myre! And then with natures harvest you can fill a druids pouch and release the Ghasts from their torment.
3	action	initial
2	option	Ok, thanks.
3	line	Player	Ok thanks.
3	action	end
0	section	Talking to Drezel
1	line	Player	Hi again. Filliman has turned into the Nature Spirit. I've just gotten the Silver sickle that he asked me to get. He says he's going to bless it!
1	line	Drezel	Well, that's great! You'd best take it to him then with all haste!
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Filliman inside his grotto again
1	cond	If the player does not have the sickle in their inventory:
2	line	Nature Spirit	Have you brought me the silver sickle?
2	line	Player	No sorry, not yet!
2	line	Nature Spirit	Well, come to me when you have it.
2	action	initial
1	cond	If the player has the silver sickle in their inventory:
2	line	Nature Spirit	Have you brought me the silver sickle?
2	line	Player	Yes, here it is. What are you going to do with it?
2	line	Nature Spirit	My friend, I will bless it for you and you will then be able to accomplish great things. Now then, I must cast the enchantment. You can bless a new sickle by dipping it in the holy water of the grotto.
2	box	~ If you lose the blessed sickle, you can bless ~~ a new sickle by dipping it in the grotto waters. ~}}
2	line	Nature Spirit	Now you can go forth and make the swamp bloom. Collect natures bounty to fill a druids pouch. So armed will the Ghasts be bound to you until, you flee or they are defeated.
2	line	Nature Spirit	Before I can make this grotto into an Altar of Nature, I need to be sure that the Ghasts will be kept at bay. Go forth into Mort Myre and slay three Ghasts. You'll be releasing their souls from Mort Myre.
2	cond	If the player does not have inventory space:
3	line	Filliman Tarlock	I would give you the druid pouch, but you don't seem to have enough space in your inventory.
3	action	end
2	cond	If the player has one free inventory space:
3	box	The nature spirit gives you an empty pouch.
3	line	Nature Spirit	You'll need this in order to collect together natures bounty. When it contains items, it will bind the Ghast to you until you flee or it is defeated.
3	action	end
