0	section	Subsequent dialogue with Filliman
1	line	Nature Spirit	Hello again my friend, have you defeated three Ghasts as I asked you?
1	line	Player	Not yet.
1	line	Nature Spirit	Well, when you do, please come to me and I'll reward you!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	How do I get to attack the Ghasts?
2	line	Player	How do I get to attack the Ghasts?
2	line	Nature Spirit	Go forth and with the sickle make the swamp bloom. Collect natures bounty to fill a druids pouch. So armed will the Ghasts be bound to you until, you flee or they are defeated.
2	action	initial
1	option	What's this pouch for?
2	line	Player	What's this pouch for?
2	line	Nature Spirit	It is for collecting natures bounty, once it contains the blossomed items of the swamp, it will make the Ghasts appear and you can then attack them.
2	action	initial
1	option	What can I do with this sickle?
2	line	Player	What can I do with this sickle?
2	line	Nature Spirit	You may use it wisely within the area of Mort Myre to affect natures balance and bring forth a bounty of natures harvest. Once collected into the druid pouch will the Ghast be apparent.
2	action	initial
1	option	I've lost my sickle.
2	line	Player	I've lost my sickle!
2	line	Nature Spirit	If you should lose the blessed sickle, simply bring another to my altar of nature and refresh it in the grotto waters.
2	action	initial
1	option	Ok, thanks.
2	line	Player	Ok thanks.
2	action	end
